WEBVTT

00:09.137 --> 00:10.137
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.241 --> 00:12.379
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.482 --> 00:13.758
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.862 --> 00:15.655
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.758 --> 00:18.310
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:18.413 --> 00:20.655
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.758 --> 00:22.206
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:22.310 --> 00:24.931
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he. ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 ♪

00:25.034 --> 00:26.413
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:26.517 --> 00:28.724
♪ If nautical nonsense be
something you wish... ♪
♪ 如果航海方面的废话是
你想要的东西...♪

00:28.827 --> 00:30.172
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:30.275 --> 00:32.724
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish. ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通。 ♪

00:32.827 --> 00:34.413
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:34.517 --> 00:36.620
♪ Ready?
SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:36.724 --> 00:39.620
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:39.724 --> 00:40.724
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.758 --> 00:43.172
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:45.482 --> 00:49.068
Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
字幕由 THE 赞助
美国教育部

00:49.172 --> 00:52.000
and NICKELODEON
和尼克国际儿童频道

01:02.034 --> 01:07.620
Ah, Goo Lagoon, a luxurious
oasis of sand and sea.
啊，Goo Lagoon，豪华的
沙滩和海洋的绿洲。

01:07.724 --> 01:09.689
Shoot, SpongeBob,
射击，海绵宝宝，

01:09.793 --> 01:10.793
how can we go swimming
我们怎样才能去游泳

01:10.827 --> 01:12.586
when you're in a shirt & tie?
当你穿着衬衫打领带时？

01:12.689 --> 01:14.379
Ah, yes, how foolish of me.
啊，是的，我真是太愚蠢了。

01:15.827 --> 01:18.551
Allow me to remedy
said situation right now.
请允许我补救
说现在的情况。

01:18.655 --> 01:20.620
I will just use
this changing tent here
我只会使用
这里的这个变化的帐篷

01:20.724 --> 01:23.413
to change into my bathing suit.
换上我的泳衣。

01:23.793 --> 01:25.344
And I won't do anything else.
而且我不会做任何其他事情。

01:25.448 --> 01:26.655
SpongeBob's acting jumpier
海绵宝宝的表演更加跳跃

01:26.758 --> 01:29.413
than a rattlesnake
in a pickle barrel.
比响尾蛇
在泡菜桶里。

01:29.517 --> 01:30.517
Wait... what?
等等……什么？

01:31.827 --> 01:34.275
Oh, I'll be changing all right,
哦，我会改变的，好吧

01:34.379 --> 01:36.068
but not into a bathing suit.
但不适合穿泳衣。

01:36.172 --> 01:40.793
Wait until Sandy sees
that I brought my karate gear!
等到桑迪看到
我带了空手道装备！

01:40.896 --> 01:41.551
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

01:41.655 --> 01:42.827
Hi... yah!
嗨...啊！

01:42.931 --> 01:45.034
Sandy won't beat me this time,
桑迪这次不会打败我了

01:45.137 --> 01:47.689
because I've got the element
on my side.
因为我已经有了元素
在我这边。

01:47.793 --> 01:50.862
The element of surprise.
惊喜的元素。

01:50.965 --> 01:51.758
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

01:51.862 --> 01:53.931
SpongeBob, are you ready?
海绵宝宝，你准备好了吗？

01:54.034 --> 01:57.310
Yes, Sandy,
I most certainly am ready!
是的，桑迪，
我当然已经准备好了！

01:57.413 --> 02:00.103
Ready to get it on.
准备好就可以上手了。

02:00.206 --> 02:02.206
Hi...
你好...

02:02.310 --> 02:03.344
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

02:03.448 --> 02:04.586
Look, SpongeBob,
看，海绵宝宝，

02:04.689 --> 02:06.275
we both brought our karate gear.
我们都带了空手道装备。

02:07.586 --> 02:10.000
Great minds
think alike, I suppose.
伟大的头脑
我想，想法是一样的。

02:10.103 --> 02:11.620
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

02:17.379 --> 02:20.827
I may be down, but I'm not out!
我可能会沮丧，但我不会出局！

02:21.724 --> 02:22.724
Way to go, buddy.
一路走好，伙计。

02:22.827 --> 02:23.827
It took us three days
我们花了三天时间

02:23.862 --> 02:25.896
to make that potato salad.
做土豆沙拉。

02:26.000 --> 02:27.586
Three days!
三天！

02:27.689 --> 02:29.241
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

02:29.344 --> 02:30.689
Sandy?
沙？

02:30.793 --> 02:33.517
Oh, I'm Sandy all right...
哦，我是桑迪，好吧……

02:33.620 --> 02:35.896
I'm very sandy.
我很沙质。

02:36.000 --> 02:36.620
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

02:36.724 --> 02:38.931
Oh, I get it.
哦，我明白了。

02:39.034 --> 02:40.172
She's "Sandy."
她是“桑迪”。

02:40.275 --> 02:43.965
That's her name and she's
also covered in... yes.
这是她的名字，她是
还涵盖...是的。

02:45.275 --> 02:48.724
Back in Texas,
we call ice cream
"frozen cow juice."
回到德克萨斯州，
我们称之为冰淇淋
“冷冻牛汁。”

02:48.827 --> 02:50.827
Excuse me for a sec.
对不起，请稍等一下。

02:50.931 --> 02:52.034
Hi... yah!
嗨...啊！

02:53.000 --> 02:53.724
Thank you.
谢谢。

02:53.827 --> 02:55.896
No, no, thank you.
不，不，谢谢。

02:56.000 --> 02:57.000
Hi-yah!
嗨呀！

03:00.965 --> 03:03.620
Who threw that
piece of paper at me?
谁扔的那个
一张纸对着我？

03:06.103 --> 03:07.655
Hey, what's everyone
嘿 大家都啥样

03:07.758 --> 03:09.344
waiting in line for?
排队等待？

03:09.448 --> 03:13.103
Ahoy, fair lass, it be the line
to get into the Salty Spitoon,
嘿，美丽的姑娘，就这样吧
进入咸痰盂，

03:13.206 --> 03:15.655
the roughest,
toughest,
sailor club
最粗暴的，
最难的，
水手俱乐部

03:15.758 --> 03:17.931
ever to be built
under the seven seas.
永远不会被建造
七大洋之下。

03:18.034 --> 03:21.172
Only the baddest of the bad
can get in.
只有最坏的坏事
可以进去。

03:21.275 --> 03:22.862
You need to have muscles.
你需要有肌肉。

03:24.275 --> 03:27.034
You need to have muscles
on your muscles.
你需要有肌肉
在你的肌肉上。

03:28.206 --> 03:31.448
You need to have muscles
on your eyeballs.
你需要有肌肉
在你的眼球上。

03:34.241 --> 03:35.655
Ew.
呃。

03:40.103 --> 03:42.793
Looks like a rip-snortin'
good time, SpongeBob.
看起来就像是在吸鼻子
好时光，海绵宝宝。

03:42.896 --> 03:44.448
Yeah, let's go in.
是的，我们进去吧。

03:44.551 --> 03:45.896
Go ahead.
前进。

03:46.000 --> 03:48.379
Welcome to the Salty Spitoon.
欢迎来到咸痰盂。

03:48.482 --> 03:49.689
How tough are ya?
你有多坚强？

03:49.793 --> 03:51.172
How tough am I?
我有多坚强？

03:51.275 --> 03:52.379
How tough am I?
我有多坚强？

03:52.482 --> 03:55.241
I had a bowl of nails
for breakfast this morning.
我有一碗钉子
今天早上吃早餐。

03:55.344 --> 03:56.103
Yeah, so?
是啊，所以？

03:56.206 --> 03:58.448
Without any milk.
没有任何牛奶。

03:58.551 --> 03:59.413
Uh, right this way.
呃，就这边。

03:59.517 --> 04:00.827
Sorry to keep you waiting.
抱歉让您久等了。

04:00.931 --> 04:02.758
Welcome to the Salty Spitoon.
欢迎来到咸痰盂。

04:02.862 --> 04:03.758
How tough are ya?
你有多坚强？

04:03.862 --> 04:06.103
How tough am I?
我有多坚强？

04:08.344 --> 04:09.862
Wow.
哇。

04:09.965 --> 04:11.551
Got any more tattoos?
还有纹身吗？

04:11.655 --> 04:14.068
Uh, that won't
be necessary.
Go ahead.
呃，那不会
有必要。
前进。

04:14.172 --> 04:15.034
Thanks!
谢谢！

04:15.137 --> 04:16.655
See ya inside, SpongeBob.
里面见，海绵宝宝。

04:16.758 --> 04:18.068
How tough are ya?
你有多坚强？

04:18.172 --> 04:18.965
How tough am I?
我有多坚强？

04:19.068 --> 04:20.931
You got a new bottle of ketchup?
你有一瓶新番茄酱吗？

04:21.034 --> 04:22.034
Sure.
当然。

04:22.068 --> 04:23.241
It's on!
开始了！

04:40.517 --> 04:43.586
If I could just run this
under some hot water...
如果我可以运行这个
在一些热水下...

04:43.689 --> 04:44.862
Get outta here.
离开这里。

04:44.965 --> 04:47.310
This place is too tough
for you, little man.
这个地方太难了
为了你，小男人。

04:47.413 --> 04:48.413
Too tough for me?
对我来说太难了？

04:48.517 --> 04:50.000
That's downright ridiculous.
这实在是太荒谬了。

04:50.103 --> 04:52.310
I'll have you know
I stubbed my toe last week
我会让你知道
上周我绊到了脚趾

04:52.413 --> 04:56.034
while watering my spice garden
and I only cried for 20 minutes.
在浇灌我的香料园时
我只哭了20分钟。

04:56.137 --> 04:59.482
Listen, kid, I think
you'd be more comfortable
听着，孩子，我想
你会更舒服

04:59.586 --> 05:00.689
over at that place.
就在那个地方。

05:00.793 --> 05:02.137
Weenie Hut Jr.'s?
小维尼小屋的？

05:02.241 --> 05:04.862
Are you saying I belong
at Weenie Hut Jr.'s?
你是说我属于
在小维尼小屋？

05:04.965 --> 05:06.482
Oh, no, sorry.
I was actually
哦，不，抱歉。
我其实是

05:06.586 --> 05:08.103
pointing to the place
next to it.
指着那个地方
在它旁边。

05:08.206 --> 05:10.655
Super Weenie Hut Jr.'s?
超级威尼小屋？

05:10.758 --> 05:12.068
Yeah.
是的。

05:12.172 --> 05:14.827
Unless you think you're
tough enough to fight me.
除非你认为你是
足够强大来与我战斗。

05:16.482 --> 05:18.862
How's your collection
coming along?
你的收藏怎么样
一起来吗？

05:18.965 --> 05:20.310
Well I don't mean to brag,
嗯，我并不是想炫耀，

05:20.413 --> 05:21.413
but it's pretty sweet.
但它很甜。

05:21.448 --> 05:23.827
I'm in the process
of acquiring issue 347
我正在这个过程中
获取问题 347

05:23.931 --> 05:26.103
which will give me
my fourth set.
这会给我
我的第四组。

05:26.206 --> 05:27.068
No!
不！

05:27.172 --> 05:28.551
What weenies.
多么可爱啊。

05:28.655 --> 05:30.206
Oh, brother.
哦，兄弟。

05:30.310 --> 05:32.931
Would you care
for another diet cola
你会在乎吗
另一种健怡可乐

05:33.034 --> 05:35.103
with a lemon twist, Weenie?
加上柠檬味，维尼？

05:35.206 --> 05:35.793
What?!
什么？！

05:35.896 --> 05:38.000
But I'm not a weenie!
但我不是小崽子！

05:39.241 --> 05:42.000
I'm sorry, sir,
but my sensors indicate
对不起，先生，
但我的传感器表明

05:42.103 --> 05:43.827
that you are indeed a weenie.
你确实是个小家伙。

05:45.689 --> 05:47.689
That's impossible!
那是不可能的！

05:47.793 --> 05:50.862
You can't hide what's inside.
你无法隐藏里面的东西。

05:52.827 --> 05:54.655
I demand entrance into your club
我要求加入你们的俱乐部

05:54.758 --> 05:57.482
on the grounds
that I am nota weenie!
理由
我不是威尼！

05:57.586 --> 05:59.241
Hey, Reg, how's it going?
嘿，雷格，怎么样？

05:59.344 --> 06:00.172
You were saying?
你说的是？

06:00.275 --> 06:01.275
Go ahead, buddy.
来吧，伙计。

06:01.344 --> 06:02.344
Thanks, Reg.
谢谢，雷格。

06:02.379 --> 06:03.931
So, your name's Reg?
那么，你的名字叫雷格？

06:04.034 --> 06:06.000
Would you get outta here?
你愿意离开这里吗？

06:06.103 --> 06:07.241
Mark my words, Reg!
记住我的话，雷格！

06:07.344 --> 06:10.413
I will get into
the Salty Spitoon!
我将进入
咸痰盂！

06:10.517 --> 06:11.551
I will!
我会！

06:11.655 --> 06:12.827
Couldn't get in, huh?
进不去吧？

06:12.931 --> 06:14.551
What you need is a tough hairdo.
你需要的是一个硬朗的发型。

06:14.655 --> 06:15.931
No one gets into the double-S
没有人进入双S

06:16.034 --> 06:17.172
without a tough hairdo.
没有硬朗的发型。

06:17.275 --> 06:18.517
I disagree... I saw a guy
我不同意...我看到一个人

06:18.620 --> 06:20.448
going in there and he was bald.
进去一看，他已经秃顶了。

06:20.551 --> 06:21.655
I saw that guy.
我看到那个人了。

06:21.758 --> 06:23.379
He wasn't bald,
he had a shaved head.
他没有秃头，
他剃了光头。

06:23.482 --> 06:24.896
Shaved... that's a hairdo.
剃光了……这就是发型。

06:25.000 --> 06:25.896
Case closed.
案件结案。

06:26.000 --> 06:27.000
Hey, where'd he go?
嘿，他去哪儿了？

06:27.103 --> 06:29.068
I believe he said something
我相信他说了些什么

06:29.172 --> 06:31.689
about going to the wig store.
关于去假发店的事情。

06:31.793 --> 06:32.620
Ha-ha!
哈哈！

06:32.724 --> 06:35.034
Check and mate!
检查并交配！

06:35.551 --> 06:37.206
What's shaking, my man?
老兄，什么在颤抖？

06:37.310 --> 06:38.103
Not much.
不多。

06:38.206 --> 06:40.310
Say, haven't I seen you before?
你说，我以前没见过你吗？

06:40.413 --> 06:43.689
Doubt it... I'm a drifter...
Just blew into town.
怀疑吧……我是个流浪者……
刚刚吹进城。

06:43.793 --> 06:45.724
Heard your club
was pretty tough.
听说你的俱乐部
非常艰难。

06:45.827 --> 06:47.310
Thought I'd check it out.
我想我会检查一下。

06:47.413 --> 06:47.931
Nice try, kid.
不错的尝试，孩子。

06:48.034 --> 06:48.931
I know it's you.
我知道是你。

06:49.034 --> 06:51.068
What are you talking about?
你在说什么？

06:51.172 --> 06:51.931
Aha!
啊哈！

06:52.034 --> 06:54.931
Hey everybody, what's going on?
大家好，发生什么事了？

07:00.103 --> 07:01.758
Ah, you can go in.
啊，你可以进去了。

07:01.862 --> 07:03.000
Sorry about that.
对此感到抱歉。

07:03.103 --> 07:04.275
And what do youwant?
你想要什么？

07:04.379 --> 07:06.827
I'd like to gain entrance
to your club, please.
我想获得入口
请到您的俱乐部。

07:06.931 --> 07:09.965
I believe my hairdo is in order.
我相信我的发型是正确的。

07:14.655 --> 07:15.724
So where do you stand
那么你站在哪里

07:15.827 --> 07:17.896
on the whole
bald vs. shaved debate?
总体而言
秃头与剃光的争论？

07:18.000 --> 07:19.068
Hey-ya, Reg.
嘿，雷格。

07:19.172 --> 07:21.034
All right, now it's a party.
好吧，现在是聚会了。

07:21.137 --> 07:23.448
Oh, yeah, check out the new ink.
哦，是的，看看新墨水。

07:23.551 --> 07:24.344
Thanks.
谢谢。

07:24.448 --> 07:26.275
Hey, look what I can make it do.
嘿，看看我能做什么。

07:28.931 --> 07:30.758
Yeah!
是的！

07:30.862 --> 07:32.068
Hey, what about that one?
嘿，那个怎么样？

07:32.172 --> 07:35.103
Huh, you know, I don't
remember getting this one.
呵呵，你知道，我不
记得买这个。

07:35.206 --> 07:36.413
Can you make it dance?
你能让它跳舞吗？

07:36.517 --> 07:37.517
Oh, here, let me try.
哦，在这里，让我试试。

07:41.034 --> 07:43.000
Hot-cha, cha-cha,
hot-cha, cha-cha.
热茶、恰恰、
热茶，恰恰。

07:43.103 --> 07:44.655
Cha-ditty-cha-ditty-cha!
恰-小调-恰-小调-恰！

07:44.758 --> 07:46.965
Hmm, wait a minute.
嗯，等一下。

07:47.068 --> 07:48.275
Go ahead in.
进去吧。

07:48.379 --> 07:49.620
Yeah, sure, Reg.
是的，当然，雷格。

07:49.724 --> 07:50.931
Thanks.
谢谢。

07:51.034 --> 07:52.965
Nice try, little man.
不错的尝试，小男人。

07:54.655 --> 07:56.931
Hey, I was in front of you!
嘿，我就在你面前！

07:57.034 --> 07:57.862
No, you weren't!
不，你不是！

07:57.965 --> 07:59.655
Are you callin' me a liar?
你是在骂我是骗子吗？

07:59.758 --> 08:01.758
I ain't callin' you for dinner!
我才不叫你吃饭呢！

08:07.310 --> 08:09.137
Hold it, you two...
That's enough.
坚持住，你们两个……
这就够了。

08:09.241 --> 08:10.689
You're both plenty tough.
你们俩都很强硬。

08:10.793 --> 08:11.689
Go ahead in.
进去吧。

08:11.793 --> 08:12.689
All right.
好的。

08:12.793 --> 08:14.034
Thanks, Reg.
谢谢，雷格。

08:14.137 --> 08:15.137
Hey, what about me?
嘿，那我呢？

08:15.241 --> 08:16.241
I was in that scrap.
我就在那个片段里。

08:16.344 --> 08:17.931
I saw you running.
我看见你跑了。

08:18.034 --> 08:20.310
When you get
in a real fight,
then we'll talk.
当你得到
在真正的战斗中，
然后我们再谈谈。

08:20.413 --> 08:25.206
Well then, I guess it's time
to take it up a notch.
那么，我想是时候了
更上一层楼。

08:40.482 --> 08:43.137
Care for another sundae, weenie?
还想再吃一份圣代吗，小威？

08:43.241 --> 08:44.241
I am not a weenie!
我不是小崽子！

08:44.275 --> 08:46.413
Relax, you're among friends.
放松点，你们是朋友。

08:46.517 --> 08:50.586
My friends don't hang out
at Weenie Hut Jr.'s.
我的朋友不出去玩
在小维尼小屋。

08:50.689 --> 08:52.344
You tell 'em, SpongeBob.
你告诉他们，海绵宝宝。

08:52.448 --> 08:54.103
Patrick, what are
you doing here?
帕特里克，什么是
你在这里做什么？

08:54.206 --> 08:56.931
I'm always here on
Double-Weenie Wednesday.
我一直都在
周三双威尼。

08:57.034 --> 08:58.103
Actually, they moved
其实他们搬家了

08:58.206 --> 08:59.793
Double-Weenie
Wednesday
to Friday.
双维尼
星期三
到星期五。

08:59.896 --> 09:01.137
Besides, today's Monday.
另外，今天是星期一。

09:01.241 --> 09:03.206
Oh, so it's Mega-Weenie Monday?
哦，所以今天是超级威尼星期一？

09:03.310 --> 09:04.862
That's now on Sunday.
现在是周日。

09:04.965 --> 09:05.827
Barnacles!
藤壶！

09:05.931 --> 09:06.724
Super Weenie
Hut Jr.'s
超级威尼
小胡特的

09:06.827 --> 09:08.137
has a Mega-Weenie Monday.
有一个超级威尼星期一。

09:08.241 --> 09:09.034
No, you're thinking
不，你在想

09:09.137 --> 09:10.275
of Monster-Weenie Monday.
怪物威尼星期一。

09:10.379 --> 09:11.655
I don't have time for this!
我没有时间做这个！

09:11.758 --> 09:14.758
I've gotta go pick a fight
with a muscular stranger.
我得去挑衅
和一个肌肉发达的陌生人。

09:14.862 --> 09:16.275
It's the only way of getting
这是获得的唯一途径

09:16.379 --> 09:17.827
into the Salty Spitoon.
进入咸痰盂。

09:17.931 --> 09:19.137
No, SpongeBob, you can't.
不，海绵宝宝，你不能。

09:19.241 --> 09:20.241
It's too dangerous.
太危险了。

09:20.310 --> 09:21.448
I've got no choice.
我别无选择。

09:21.551 --> 09:23.241
I have a suggestion.
我有一个建议。

09:23.344 --> 09:25.413
Why not fake a fight?
为什么不假装打架呢？

09:25.517 --> 09:28.448
Hey, that's not a bad idea!
嘿，这不是一个坏主意！

09:28.551 --> 09:31.000
You can call me
a couple of bad names,
你可以打电话给我
几个不好的名字，

09:31.103 --> 09:32.827
we rumble, next thing you know
我们隆隆作响，接下来你知道的

09:32.931 --> 09:34.206
you're in the Salty Spitoon.
你在咸痰盂里。

09:34.310 --> 09:37.344
Well, I guess I've
got nothing to lose.
嗯，我想我已经
没有什么可失去的。

09:37.448 --> 09:38.241
Let's do it!
我们开始做吧！

09:38.344 --> 09:39.620
Yeah!
是的！

09:40.275 --> 09:41.137
Hey, how come you never
嘿嘿，你怎么从来不

09:41.241 --> 09:42.448
help us with our problems?
帮助我们解决问题？

09:42.551 --> 09:46.034
I am a robot,
not a miracle worker.
我是一个机器人，
不是奇迹创造者。

09:46.137 --> 09:47.000
Afternoon, Reg.
下午，注册。

09:47.103 --> 09:48.551
Whoa, whoa, little man.
哇哦，小男人。

09:48.655 --> 09:50.103
You still can't go in.
你还是不能进去。

09:50.206 --> 09:53.310
Well, that makes me pretty mad.
嗯，这让我很生气。

09:53.413 --> 09:54.413
Oh, yeah?
哦，是吗？

09:54.448 --> 09:55.275
Yeah.
是的。

09:55.379 --> 09:56.689
I might have to beat someone up
我可能不得不殴打某人

09:56.793 --> 09:58.965
just to get rid
of all this blind fury.
只是为了摆脱
所有这些盲目的愤怒。

09:59.068 --> 10:00.620
Wow.
哇。

10:00.724 --> 10:04.137
I feel pretty sorry for the
next guy who looks at me funny.
我感到很遗憾
下一个用滑稽的眼神看着我的人。

10:04.241 --> 10:06.137
Hmm... what about
that guy?
嗯……那又如何呢
那个家伙？

10:07.689 --> 10:09.689
I...
don't be silly,
我...
别傻了

10:09.793 --> 10:11.103
he's not bothering anybody.
他没有打扰任何人。

10:11.206 --> 10:14.103
I mean, not like...
that guy!
我的意思是，不喜欢...
那个家伙！

10:14.689 --> 10:15.689
Who, me?
谁，我？

10:15.793 --> 10:16.896
Yeah, you.
是的，你。

10:17.000 --> 10:18.355
Standing there all
smiling and whatnot.
全部站在那里
微笑什么的。

10:18.379 --> 10:21.000
Somebody ought to teach
you some manners.
应该有人教教
你有点礼貌。

10:21.103 --> 10:23.034
Okay, but I must warn you.
好吧，但我必须警告你。

10:23.137 --> 10:28.241
I happen to be a world
championship... uh...
我恰好是一个世界
冠军……呃……

10:28.344 --> 10:31.206
"kick... box... er."
“踢……盒子……呃。”

10:31.689 --> 10:35.137
I don't care if you're
the demon seed
of Davey Jones!
我不在乎你是否
恶魔种子
戴维琼斯！

10:35.241 --> 10:37.517
You're going down, Tubby!
你要倒下了，塔比！

10:38.931 --> 10:40.689
Tubby?
胖乎乎的？

10:43.793 --> 10:46.068
Nobody calls me Tubby!
没人叫我塔比！

10:47.068 --> 10:48.413
Wait, Patrick.
等等，帕特里克。

10:48.517 --> 10:50.620
You're supposed to
let mewin, remember?
你应该
让我温一下，记得吗？

10:50.724 --> 10:51.724
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

10:54.655 --> 10:56.068
No, please wait!
不，请稍等！

11:16.000 --> 11:19.758
No, please, have mercy.
不，请怜悯。

11:25.241 --> 11:26.275
Wow!
哇！

11:26.379 --> 11:27.275
You destroyed that guy
你毁了那个人

11:27.379 --> 11:29.310
without even touching him!
甚至没有碰他！

11:29.413 --> 11:30.758
I did?
我做到了？

11:30.862 --> 11:32.586
I never thought I'd say this,
我从没想过我会说出这样的话

11:32.689 --> 11:34.965
but...
go ahead in.
但是...
进去吧。

11:35.068 --> 11:36.448
Really?
真的吗？

11:36.551 --> 11:37.827
I can go in?
我可以进去吗？

11:37.931 --> 11:41.068
Oh, my gosh, I never thought
this moment would come!
哦，天哪，我从来没想过
这一刻将会到来！

11:41.172 --> 11:42.517
I, SpongeBob SquarePants,
我，海绵宝宝，

11:42.620 --> 11:46.068
am tough enough to get
into the Salty Spitoon!
我足够坚强才能得到
进入咸痰盂！

11:46.172 --> 11:51.241
This is the happiest day
of my life!
这是最幸福的一天
我的生活！

11:54.413 --> 11:55.448
Sandy?
沙？

11:57.206 --> 11:58.344
What happened?
发生了什么？

11:58.448 --> 12:01.275
You ran inside and
slipped on an ice cube.
你跑进去然后
在冰块上滑倒了。

12:03.344 --> 12:04.655
What happened?
发生了什么？

12:04.758 --> 12:09.172
I slipped on an ice cube
and got covered in boo-boos.
我在冰块上滑倒了
并充满了嘘声。

12:09.275 --> 12:10.448
Boo-boos, eh?
嘘嘘，嗯？

12:10.551 --> 12:12.172
I think you guys
want thathospital.
我想你们
想要那家医院。

12:12.275 --> 12:13.655
Weenie Hut General?!
威尼小屋将军？！

12:26.137 --> 12:31.344
Ten, nine, eight, seven,
six, five, four,
十、九、八、七、
六、五、四、

12:31.448 --> 12:33.482
three, two, one.
三，二，一。

12:33.586 --> 12:36.344
I'm done with my shift,
Mr. Krabs!
我的轮班结束了
蟹老板！

12:36.448 --> 12:37.896
And let me just say,
我只想说，

12:38.000 --> 12:41.482
there will come a day when I
will make something of my life
总有一天我会
会让我的生活变得有意义

12:41.586 --> 12:47.172
and I will never have to set
foot in this grease trap again!
我永远不需要设置
再次踏入这个油脂陷阱！

12:47.275 --> 12:48.482
Yeah, we'll see you
是的，我们会见到你

12:48.586 --> 12:50.758
after your lunch break,
Squidward.
午休后，
章鱼哥。

12:50.862 --> 12:52.965
Okay.
好的。

12:54.241 --> 12:56.758
So I just took my private yacht
所以我就开着我的私人游艇

12:56.862 --> 12:59.655
across my private lake
to my private heliport.
穿过我的私人湖
到我的私人直升机场。

12:59.758 --> 13:02.862
It's the only way
off my private island.
这是唯一的方法
离开我的私人岛屿。

13:02.965 --> 13:04.517
Oh, shrimp!
噢，虾！

13:04.620 --> 13:07.655
It's my arch rival from high
school, Squilliam Fancyson!
这是我的劲敌
学校，斯奎利亚姆·凡西森！

13:07.758 --> 13:10.655
I can't let him see me
in my Krusty Krab uniform.
我不能让他看到我
穿着我的蟹堡王制服。

13:10.758 --> 13:14.379
On your lunch break,
eh, Squiddy?
午休的时候，
呃，鱿鱼？

13:14.482 --> 13:17.482
Yes... I mean no...
I mean... uh, uh...
是的...我的意思是不...
我的意思是……呃，呃……

13:17.586 --> 13:19.068
Hey, whatcha been up to?
嘿，最近在忙什么？

13:19.172 --> 13:23.310
Oh, just succeeding in
everything you've failed in.
Oh, just succeeding in
你失败的一切。

13:23.413 --> 13:25.862
You are no great shakes,
Squilliam Fancyson!
你不是什么大人物，
斯奎利亚姆·奇森！

13:25.965 --> 13:30.758
Anyone can be a big shot in
a hick town like Bikini Bottom.
任何人都可以成为大人物
像比基尼堡这样的乡下小镇

13:30.862 --> 13:32.172
Oh, is that so?
哦，是这样吗？

13:32.275 --> 13:35.137
Let's hear what you've
accomplished
让我们听听你有什么
完成的

13:35.241 --> 13:36.862
since high school, Squiddy.
从高中开始，鱿鱼。

13:36.965 --> 13:39.482
Don't be intimidated, Squidward.
别被吓倒了，章鱼哥。

13:39.586 --> 13:41.758
Try to imagine him
in his underwear.
试着想象他
在他的内衣里。

13:44.344 --> 13:46.000
Oh, no, he's hot!
哦，不，他很热！

13:46.103 --> 13:49.517
I'm, uh, in... food service.
我，呃，在……餐饮服务行业。

13:49.620 --> 13:51.896
Hold it, don't tell me...
等等，别告诉我...

13:52.000 --> 13:53.172
You're a cashier!
你是收银员！

13:54.586 --> 13:56.068
Don't lie.
不要说谎。

13:56.172 --> 13:57.586
Lying always makes it worse.
说谎总是会让事情变得更糟。

13:57.689 --> 13:59.517
I own a five-star restaurant!
我拥有一家五星级餐厅！

13:59.620 --> 14:04.758
Squidward, I had no idea
you were such a success.
章鱼哥，我不知道
你太成功了。

14:04.862 --> 14:05.482
That's right!
这是正确的！

14:05.586 --> 14:07.241
And I would be honored
我将很荣幸

14:07.344 --> 14:11.172
if you would allow me
to come to yourrestaurant...
if you would allow me
来你的餐厅...

14:11.275 --> 14:12.448
tonight.
今晚。

14:14.655 --> 14:17.068
T-t-t-t-t-t-tonight?
今晚？今晚？

14:17.172 --> 14:19.827
In fact, we'll all come.
事实上，我们都会来。

14:19.931 --> 14:21.344
My treat!
我请客！

14:23.724 --> 14:26.620
Please, Mr. Krabs,
you got to help me!
蟹老板，请您
你一定要帮我！

14:26.724 --> 14:27.931
When they get here tonight
当他们今晚到达这里时

14:28.034 --> 14:31.172
they'll see I'm just
a big phony and a loser!
他们会看到我只是
一个大骗子，一个失败者！

14:31.275 --> 14:33.000
Oh, boo-hoo!
哦，嘘！

14:33.103 --> 14:37.793
Let me play a sad song for you
on the world's smallest violin.
让我为你奏一首悲伤的歌
世界上最小的小提琴。

14:37.896 --> 14:38.586
This is serious.
这很严重。

14:38.689 --> 14:40.103
I know... this really is
我知道……这确实是

14:40.206 --> 14:42.206
the world's smallest violin.
世界上最小的小提琴。

14:42.310 --> 14:43.689
See?
看？

14:43.793 --> 14:45.103
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

14:45.206 --> 14:47.172
Please let me run the restaurant
请让我来经营餐厅

14:47.275 --> 14:48.344
for just one night!
只住一晚！

14:48.448 --> 14:50.896
I really need
to impress Squilliam.
我真的需要
to impress Squilliam.

14:51.000 --> 14:53.517
Sq-Sq-Sq-Squilliam?
平方-平方-平方-斯奎利亚姆？

14:53.620 --> 14:54.660
That guy who made millions
那个赚了几百万的人

14:54.758 --> 14:56.896
doing what you
wish you could do?
doing what you
希望你能做什么？

14:57.000 --> 14:58.034
Don't rub it in.
别把它擦进去。

14:58.137 --> 14:59.482
Why didn't you tell me?
你为什么不告诉我？

14:59.586 --> 15:02.344
We'll take him to the cleaners!
我们要带他去清洁工！

15:02.724 --> 15:04.068
All right, listen up!
好吧，听着！

15:04.172 --> 15:06.965
Men, Squilliam Fancyson
will be here in 20 minutes.
斯奎利亚姆·凡西森 (Squilliam Fancyson) 男士
20 分钟后到。

15:07.068 --> 15:09.758
Therefore, we need
to turn the Krusty Krab
因此，我们需要
转动蟹堡

15:09.862 --> 15:12.448
into a fancy restaurant
as soon as possible!
走进一家高级餐厅
尽快！

15:12.551 --> 15:14.448
Patrick, what are you
doing here?
帕特里克，你是什么？
在这里做什么？

15:14.551 --> 15:15.655
I thought the Corps
我以为是军团

15:15.758 --> 15:17.793
would straighten out
my life, sir!
会理顺
我的生活，先生！

15:17.896 --> 15:18.517
The Corps?
军团？

15:18.620 --> 15:19.448
What the...?
什么……？

15:19.551 --> 15:20.896
Patrick this isn't the...
帕特里克，这不是...

15:21.000 --> 15:23.862
Beggars can't be choosers.
乞丐不能挑挑拣拣。

15:23.965 --> 15:24.965
Can you take hats
帽子可以带吗

15:25.068 --> 15:27.034
in a dignified and
sophisticated manner?
以一种庄严而
复杂的方式？

15:27.137 --> 15:28.965
You mean like a weenie?
你是说像小威尼？

15:29.068 --> 15:29.758
Okay!
好的！

15:29.862 --> 15:32.137
May I take your hat, sir?
先生，我可以拿走你的帽子吗？

15:32.241 --> 15:34.413
May I take your hat, sir?
先生，我可以拿走你的帽子吗？

15:34.517 --> 15:35.517
May I...
我可以...

15:35.586 --> 15:36.734
All right, I've heard enough.
好吧，我已经听够了。

15:36.758 --> 15:38.206
You've got the job.
你得到了这份工作。

15:38.310 --> 15:41.724
Mr. Krabs, didn't you once
serve on the S.S. Gourmet?
蟹老板，你不是曾经吗
服务于 S.S Gourmet？

15:41.827 --> 15:42.551
Aye-aye!
是啊是啊！

15:42.655 --> 15:44.275
Then you'll be our chef.
那你就是我们的厨师了。

15:44.379 --> 15:45.448
What can I do?
我能做些什么？

15:45.551 --> 15:46.831
I can't believe I'm saying this,
我不敢相信我会这么说

15:46.862 --> 15:50.448
but, SpongeBob, you're going
to have to be the waiter.
但是，海绵宝宝，你要去
必须是服务员。

15:50.551 --> 15:51.793
What's that?
那是什么？

15:51.896 --> 15:54.206
It's the guy who goes
to tables and takes orders.
就是那个要走的人
到餐桌并接受订单。

15:54.310 --> 15:55.965
Do other restaurants do that?
其他餐厅也这样做吗？

15:56.068 --> 15:56.965
Yes, they do that!
是的，他们就是这么做的！

15:57.068 --> 15:58.655
Now listen,
Squilliam is on his way
现在听，
斯奎利姆正在赶来的路上

15:58.758 --> 16:00.517
and you have
less than 20 minutes
你有
不到20分钟

16:00.620 --> 16:02.172
to become a fancy waiter,
成为一名出色的服务员，

16:02.275 --> 16:03.275
so read this.
所以读一下这个。

16:03.344 --> 16:04.586
"How To Become a Fancy Waiter
《如何成为一名出色的服务员

16:04.689 --> 16:06.068
in Less Than 20 Minutes."
不到20分钟。”

16:06.172 --> 16:07.241
Don't worry, Squidward,
别担心，章鱼哥

16:07.344 --> 16:08.551
I'll memorize every page...
我会记住每一页...

16:08.655 --> 16:09.862
Right down to the punctuation!
直接到标点符号就可以了！

16:09.965 --> 16:12.586
All right, I've got
all the positions filled.
好吧，我有
所有职位均已满。

16:12.689 --> 16:14.482
I just might pull this off.
我可能会成功。

16:14.586 --> 16:15.586
Give me that hat!
把那顶帽子给我！

16:15.689 --> 16:17.689
I said give it to me!
我说给我吧！

16:17.793 --> 16:20.586
Are you going to
hand it over or not?
你要去吗
交还是不交？

16:20.689 --> 16:22.137
Don't you back-sass me!
你别跟我顶嘴啊！

16:23.689 --> 16:26.965
He's just the hat-check guy,
nothing essential!
他只是个检查帽子的人
没什么必要的！

16:28.689 --> 16:30.758
What happened?
What is it?
发生了什么？
它是什么？

16:30.862 --> 16:31.758
Peas!
豌豆！

16:31.862 --> 16:33.044
Made 'em the old-fashioned way.
用老式的方法做的。

16:33.068 --> 16:35.931
Mr. Krabs, you got
to take them out of the...
蟹老板，你有
把他们带出...

16:36.034 --> 16:39.586
Holy fish paste, what is that?
圣鱼酱，那是什么？

16:39.689 --> 16:41.620
That's the appetizer!
这就是开胃菜！

16:41.724 --> 16:42.931
But, I thought you said
但是，我以为你说

16:43.034 --> 16:45.517
you were the head chef
on the S.S. Gourmet?
你是主厨
在 S.S. 美食上？

16:45.620 --> 16:46.896
Did I say that?
我有这么说过吗？

16:47.000 --> 16:48.862
No, I cleaned
the bathrooms
on the Gourmet.
不，我清理过
浴室
关于美食。

16:48.965 --> 16:51.586
I was the head chef
on the S.S. Diarrhea.
我是主厨
关于 S.S 腹泻。

16:51.689 --> 16:52.689
There you are!
你在那里！

16:52.724 --> 16:54.379
SpongeBob, you got to help me!
海绵宝宝，你一定要帮帮我！

16:54.482 --> 16:56.655
Patrick and Mr. Krabs
aren't working out
帕特里克和蟹老板
没锻炼好

16:56.758 --> 16:58.310
and Squilliam's almost here,
斯奎利姆就快到了，

16:58.413 --> 16:59.965
and, and... SpongeBob?
还有，还有……海绵宝宝？

17:02.379 --> 17:03.379
I can't do it.
我做不到。

17:03.413 --> 17:05.862
I can't do it, Squidward.
我做不到，章鱼哥。

17:05.965 --> 17:06.965
What?
什么？

17:07.034 --> 17:09.413
Every sentence,
every paragraph...
每一句话，
每一段...

17:09.517 --> 17:11.517
Spoons! Bread! Salad! Pepper!
勺子！面包！沙拉！胡椒！

17:11.620 --> 17:12.724
Don't you understand?
你不明白吗？

17:12.827 --> 17:14.758
My brain is full to bursting!
我的大脑已经充满到爆炸了！

17:14.862 --> 17:16.793
If I have to memorize
a single order,
如果我必须记住
单一订单，

17:16.896 --> 17:18.689
I think I'm going to explode!
我觉得我要爆炸了！

17:18.793 --> 17:20.034
SpongeBob, hold on!
海绵宝宝，坚持住！

17:20.137 --> 17:24.931
Let's just take a second here
to relax.
让我们稍等一下
放松。

17:26.448 --> 17:28.724
Little more...
再多一点...

17:30.482 --> 17:32.758
Little more...
再多一点...

17:34.620 --> 17:35.793
Good.
好的。

17:35.896 --> 17:40.103
Now... I want you
to empty your mind.
现在...我想要你
清空你的头脑。

17:40.206 --> 17:42.103
Empty my mind?
清空我的头脑？

17:42.206 --> 17:44.448
Empty your mind.
清空你的头脑。

17:44.551 --> 17:46.655
Empty my mind.
清空我的思绪。

17:46.758 --> 17:49.034
Empty your mind of everything
清空脑子里的一切

17:49.137 --> 17:52.655
that doesn't have to do
with fine dining.
那不必做
与美食。

17:52.758 --> 17:56.896
Fine dining and breathing...
美食和呼吸......

17:58.586 --> 17:59.866
Just got an order from the boss:
刚刚接到老板的命令：

17:59.965 --> 18:02.827
dump everything that
isn't about fine dining!
倾倒一切
不是关于美食！

18:02.931 --> 18:04.206
Everything?
一切？

18:04.310 --> 18:05.172
Everything.
一切。

18:05.275 --> 18:06.103
Come on, come on!
来吧，来吧！

18:06.206 --> 18:07.206
Quicker, quicker!
快点，快点！

18:09.068 --> 18:11.827
Start dumping, start dumping.
开始倾倒，开始倾倒。

18:11.931 --> 18:14.034
Come on, let's get moving!
来吧，让我们行动起来吧！

18:14.137 --> 18:14.793
Hurry up!
赶快！

18:14.896 --> 18:16.482
What am I paying you for?
我付钱给你做什么？

18:16.586 --> 18:17.689
You don't pay me.
你不付钱给我。

18:17.793 --> 18:18.793
We don't even exist.
我们甚至不存在。

18:18.896 --> 18:20.182
We're just a clever
visual metaphor
我们只是一个聪明人
视觉隐喻

18:20.206 --> 18:22.965
used to personify
the abstract concept
of thought.
用于拟人化
抽象概念
的思想。

18:23.068 --> 18:26.586
One more crack like that
and you're out of here!
又一个这样的裂缝
你就离开这里了！

18:26.689 --> 18:27.689
No, please!
不，拜托！

18:27.758 --> 18:28.758
I have three kids!
我有三个孩子！

18:38.689 --> 18:40.724
How do you feel?
你感觉如何？

18:41.758 --> 18:42.758
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

18:46.482 --> 18:47.724
This isn't working!
这不行！

18:47.827 --> 18:50.344
I gotta go tell Squilliam
I need more time!
我得去告诉斯奎利亚姆
我需要更多时间！

18:50.448 --> 18:52.551
I'll just go and tell him...
我这就去告诉他...

18:52.655 --> 18:53.482
You're here!
你来了！

18:53.586 --> 18:54.896
Hello, Squiddy!
你好，乌贼！

18:55.000 --> 18:56.931
We're all ready to be dazzled
我们都准备好眼花缭乱

18:57.034 --> 18:59.068
by your five-star restaurant.
在您的五星级餐厅旁。

18:59.172 --> 18:59.862
Wait, Squilliam!
等等，斯奎利亚姆！

18:59.965 --> 19:01.275
I've got to explain!
我得解释一下！

19:01.379 --> 19:02.482
Explain what?
解释什么？

19:02.586 --> 19:04.758
That you, Squidward Tentacles,
你，章鱼哥触手，

19:04.862 --> 19:08.862
voted most likely
to suck eggs
n high school,
投票最有可能
吸鸡蛋
高中时，

19:08.965 --> 19:12.413
are trying to pass off
a lousy burger stand
正在试图冒充
一个糟糕的汉堡摊

19:12.517 --> 19:14.586
as a five-star...
作为五星级...

19:15.896 --> 19:18.137
restaurant?
餐厅？

19:20.275 --> 19:22.103
Hommina, hommina,
hommina, hommina...
人类，人类，
人类，人类……

19:22.206 --> 19:23.896
Hommina, hommina, hommina...
人类，人类，人类……

19:24.000 --> 19:26.862
Hommina, hommina, hommina,
hommina, hommina...
霍米纳，霍米纳，霍米纳，
人类，人类……

19:26.965 --> 19:28.862
Table for Hommina?
Hommina 的桌子？

19:28.965 --> 19:30.758
I can seat you immediately.
我可以立即为您安排座位。

19:30.862 --> 19:33.000
How did you do all this?
你是怎么做到这一切的？

19:33.103 --> 19:34.862
It was easy... once
I cleared my mind.
这很容易...一次
我理清思绪。

19:34.965 --> 19:37.206
But what about
Krabs and Patrick?
但是呢
蟹老板和帕特里克？

19:37.310 --> 19:38.310
Taken care of.
得到照顾。

19:40.000 --> 19:42.413
Right this way, please.
请这边走。

19:46.689 --> 19:47.517
Good evening, sir.
晚上好，先生。

19:47.620 --> 19:48.724
From our menu tonight,
从我们今晚的菜单来看，

19:48.827 --> 19:50.267
might I recommend
the Krabby Newburg?
我可以推荐吗
克拉比纽堡？

19:50.310 --> 19:53.000
We take the finest cuts
of aged, imported kelp,
我们采取最好的切割
陈年进口海带，

19:53.103 --> 19:55.448
stuff them with herbs
from our garden,
用草药填充它们
从我们的花园，

19:55.551 --> 19:56.551
wrap them in parchment
用羊皮纸包裹它们

19:56.655 --> 19:57.793
with our shallot tapenade,
配上我们的葱酱，

19:57.896 --> 20:00.103
roast them for hours
in our wood-fired oven,
将它们烤几个小时
在我们的燃木烤箱中，

20:00.206 --> 20:02.241
and serve them with wilted coral
并用枯萎的珊瑚来招待他们

20:02.344 --> 20:03.344
on a mahogany plank.
在桃花心木板上。

20:03.413 --> 20:06.793
Mmm... this is
fantastic!
嗯……这是
太棒了！

20:06.896 --> 20:07.793
Thank you, sir.
谢谢您，先生。

20:07.896 --> 20:10.586
Pinch me, I must be dreaming.
掐我一下，我一定是在做梦。

20:12.068 --> 20:13.586
If you need
anything else,
just call.
如果您需要
其他任何事情，
就打电话吧。

20:13.689 --> 20:15.793
SpongeBob, I can't
thank you enough
海绵宝宝我不行
谢谢你够了

20:15.896 --> 20:17.172
for all you're doing!
为了你所做的一切！

20:17.275 --> 20:20.241
Fine dining and breathing
are all I know how to do.
美食与呼吸
我只知道该怎么做。

20:21.862 --> 20:23.275
It worked.
它起作用了。

20:23.379 --> 20:24.482
I can't believe it!
我简直不敢相信！

20:24.586 --> 20:27.965
Squilliam thinks I own
a five-star restaurant.
斯奎利姆认为我拥有
一家五星级餐厅。

20:28.068 --> 20:31.310
Time to rub it in his face.
是时候把它擦在他脸上了。

20:34.172 --> 20:36.827
Well, Squilliam, I'm waiting.
好吧，斯奎利姆，我在等。

20:36.931 --> 20:39.413
All right, I admit it.
好吧，我承认。

20:39.517 --> 20:41.379
Everything is fabulous!
一切都很棒！

20:41.482 --> 20:45.793
The food, the atmosphere...
Everything's flawless!
食物、气氛……
一切都完美无缺！

20:45.896 --> 20:47.931
In that case,
I need you to read this.
在那种情况下，
我需要你读一下这个。

20:48.034 --> 20:49.413
"Squidward Tentacles..."
“章鱼哥的触手……”

20:49.517 --> 20:50.689
And I need you to wear this.
我需要你穿上这个。

20:50.793 --> 20:53.655
Oh, eh, "Squidward Tentacles
has the fanciest..."
哦，呃，《章鱼哥的触手》
有最奇特的……”

20:53.758 --> 20:55.034
I'm sorry, one more time.
对不起，再来一次。

20:55.137 --> 20:57.965
"Squidward Tentacles has
the fanciest restaurant
“章鱼哥的触手有
最豪华的餐厅

20:58.068 --> 21:01.793
in Bikini Bottom...
and he does not suck eggs."
在比基尼底部...
而且他不吸鸡蛋。”

21:04.000 --> 21:06.379
Squidward, I must tell you...
章鱼哥，我必须告诉你……

21:06.482 --> 21:07.827
Thank you.
谢谢。

21:07.931 --> 21:11.000
What really won me over
was your brilliant waiter.
是什么真正让我着迷
是你出色的服务员。

21:11.103 --> 21:12.793
It's as if all he knows
仿佛他所知道的一切

21:12.896 --> 21:15.034
is fine dining and breathing.
是美食和呼吸。

21:15.137 --> 21:16.793
I must know your name.
我必须知道你的名字。

21:18.862 --> 21:19.724
My name?
我的名字？

21:19.827 --> 21:21.034
Yes, your name, son.
是的，你的名字，儿子。

21:21.137 --> 21:24.310
Uh, Beef Wellington?
呃，惠灵顿牛肉？

21:24.413 --> 21:25.827
No, your name.
不，你的名字。

21:25.931 --> 21:28.620
Uh... er...
呃……呃……

21:28.724 --> 21:30.137
The fork on the left?
左边的叉子？

21:30.241 --> 21:30.896
Stop joking.
别开玩笑了。

21:31.000 --> 21:32.172
Tell him our name.
告诉他我们的名字。

21:32.275 --> 21:33.172
My name...
我的名字...

21:33.275 --> 21:34.862
What's his name?
What's his name?
他叫什么名字？
他叫什么名字？

21:34.965 --> 21:36.137
I got nothing on a name!
我对名字一无所知！

21:36.241 --> 21:39.310
Come on baby, what's the name?
来吧宝贝，叫什么名字？

21:42.827 --> 21:44.620
We threw out his name!
我们把他的名字扔掉了！

21:49.206 --> 21:50.379
Uh...
呃...

21:52.448 --> 21:53.689
I am so very sorry!
我非常非常抱歉！

21:53.793 --> 21:56.620
I don't know what
has gotten into that...
我不知道什么
已经陷入那个……

21:57.689 --> 21:59.586
More soup for your armpits?
腋下还要喝汤吗？

22:01.137 --> 22:03.103
Please enjoy the food!
请尽情享受美食吧！

22:03.206 --> 22:06.620
Would you like some cheese
on that, sir?
你想要一些奶酪吗
关于这一点，先生？

22:06.724 --> 22:08.931
Ow, ow, ow, ow!
噢，噢，噢，噢！

22:11.413 --> 22:12.931
No, no!
不，不！

22:14.724 --> 22:19.862
Run for your lives, everyone,
it's the appetizer!
大家为自己的生命奔跑吧
这是开胃菜！

22:32.103 --> 22:36.172
Well, Squiddy, I'm waiting.
好吧，鱿鱼，我在等。

22:36.827 --> 22:38.206
Okay, I admit it!
好吧，我承认！

22:38.310 --> 22:39.517
I'm a fraud!
我是个骗子！

22:39.620 --> 22:43.241
This was all a futile,
pathetic attempt
to impress you.
这一切都是徒劳，
可悲的尝试
给你留下深刻印象。

22:43.344 --> 22:46.034
This isn't really my restaurant!
这真的不是我的餐厅！

22:46.137 --> 22:48.103
I'm just a cashier!
我只是一个收银员！

22:48.206 --> 22:51.034
Squidward, I understand.
章鱼哥，我明白了。

22:51.137 --> 22:54.275
I have a confession
to make myself.
我有一个忏悔
使我自己。

22:54.379 --> 22:57.620
I made everything up
about my life.
我编造了一切
关于我的生活。

22:57.724 --> 23:00.137
I have no yachts,
jets or anything.
我没有游艇
喷气式飞机或任何东西。

23:00.241 --> 23:03.206
I was only trying
to impress you.
我只是想尝试
给你留下深刻印象。

23:03.310 --> 23:09.689
The horrible, sad truth is
I'm a cashier, too!
可怕而悲伤的事实是
我也是收银员！

23:15.413 --> 23:17.965
Is that true?
这是真的吗？

23:18.068 --> 23:18.862
Of course not!
当然不是！

23:18.965 --> 23:20.379
I'm filthy, stinking rich!
我是肮脏的，发臭的富翁！

23:20.482 --> 23:21.586
Come on, everyone!
加油，大家！

23:21.689 --> 23:25.620
Let's all take a ride
in my balloon/casino.
大家一起去搭车吧
在我的气球/赌场里。

23:25.724 --> 23:26.965
Hooray!
万岁！

23:33.137 --> 23:34.275
I got such a headache.
我真是头疼极了。

23:34.379 --> 23:36.000
What's going on with you?
你怎么了？

23:36.103 --> 23:37.103
Oh, the usual.
哦，平常的。

23:40.172 --> 23:48.034
Would you get out of here!
你能离开这里吗？

23:48.137 --> 23:51.275
[And NICKELODEON]
[还有尼克频道]

[还有尼克频道]